      "writtenOn": "2026-08-18T06:16:01Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "My understanding: Before this patch, pamUserCheckAuthenticate() used \"dropbear\" as the PAM service, which caused IPMI auth events to appear as SSH sessions in audit logs and shared the same PAM config/lockout counters with dropbear. This patch fixes that by giving IPMI its own PAM service identity.\n\nPlease Correct me if my understanding is wrong ?",
